  "limits": [
    "The Kenney base mirror and the Godot mapping use byte-identical SVGs. Kenney RPG is a separate asset pack by the same artist. raygui Light is a separately authored code-defined theme.",
    "TGUI BabyBlue references an external illustration and the sampled TGUI theme documents did not explicitly grant reuse of its graphical atlas. It is excluded from the contact sheet. The Godot voxel readme specifies mixed artwork terms and was not selected."
  ],
